{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2020-09", "window": 1, "start_date": 1598918400, "end_date": 1599523199, "month_true_total": 51, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:51:47 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "75617145", "author": {"steamid": "76561198142282693", "personaname": "MiserableCorgi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198142282693/", "num_games_owned": 549, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 8058, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4633, "last_played": 1668280715, "avatar": "14c94ace391b90e2c5c3e07e44f518f25a3d4376"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just as glitchy as i remember it being. Good times", "timestamp_created": 1599513890, "timestamp_updated": 1599513890, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 19, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.649882316589355469", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75603732", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970667419", "personaname": "The Pantheon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ThePantheon/", "num_games_owned": 484, "num_reviews": 173, "playtime_forever": 3692, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3692, "last_played": 1599495428, "avatar": "b1b206f54c8ed9f70bbf3fa6af9897e105c8dd65"}, "language": "english", "review": "Phenomenal, even a second time around almost a decade later. Especially the DLCs and of course, the characters. And of course of course: ALOT texture mods + a few other PC improvements. Origin is easy to disable in game, did it once and had no problems. What a TRILOGY!", "timestamp_created": 1599495708, "timestamp_updated": 1599495708, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75571850", "author": {"steamid": "76561198074138920", "personaname": "faricellic", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198074138920/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 5096, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1617, "last_played": 1763505094, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game is great but having to mess with Orion servers wrecks the experience.", "timestamp_created": 1599440420, "timestamp_updated": 1599440420, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.454045116901397705", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75563453", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993115244", "personaname": "Snowscoran", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197993115244/", "num_games_owned": 178, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 4112, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2497, "last_played": 1601699425, "avatar": "f3d05db4d8557efbcdbfb337f4176abe9fcb5c1b"}, "language": "english", "review": "I came to Mass Effect 3 with low expectations, and somehow, I still ended up disappointed.\n\nIt's a competent cover shooter with RPG elements. I'll give it that much. But the things that made the first two games great- creative storytelling and worldbuilding in the first, and the excellent character and dialogue in the second- are absent here. The third installation in the series has nothing new to offer, and does many things worse than the two first games.\n\nIt's a worrying sign in an RPG when one of the first things that start annoying you is the lack of an ability to skip cutscenes. But that's exactly what happened to me here from an early stage, because the story this time around just isn't that good. Quite often, it's really cringy.\nMost inexcusably, the ending of a trilogy chock full of supposedly meaningful choices is largely unaffected by anything but the selection of which lever out of three available ones to pull at the end.\n\nWriting this review makes me sad because I remember being excited about the series when it was new, and as it turned out EA pissed all that potential away. The best thing I can say about this is it was nice to be done with it.", "timestamp_created": 1599425026, "timestamp_updated": 1601700226, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.382472753524780273", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75558811", "author": {"steamid": "76561198137860044", "personaname": "MasterPatsy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MasterPatsy/", "num_games_owned": 425, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1451, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 885, "last_played": 1601593223, "avatar": "a1a2d449126c6b1e80b1840d688416d98755760c"}, "language": "english", "review": "A classic game. IMO not as good as ME2 but if you like classic Bioware games, this is definitely one that you need to play.\nIt was story telling at it's best with a really fun combat system. Highly recommended!!", "timestamp_created": 1599418546, "timestamp_updated": 1599418546, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": 